,"committedDate":"2025-09-28T13:17:46Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:29:28.245Z","repositoryId":1065787125,"sha":"aeb4b286fe964e262a9e04dc2d0d2bbc61f76bc3"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"authoredDate":"2025-09-28T12:35:27Z","committedDate":"2025-09-28T12:35:27Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:29:28.245Z","repositoryId":1065787125,"sha":"9fa9643babade1bdb2439dab0949c628ceda9af4"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"authoredDate":"2025-09-28T12:31:39Z","committedDate":"2025-09-28T12:31:39Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:29:28.245Z","repositoryId":1065787125,"sha":"d61e802db35d6369fb100597bac299060fdf69b7"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"authoredDate":"2025-09-27T02:54:08Z","committedDate":"2025-09-27T02:54:08Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:29:28.245Z","repositoryId":1065787125,"sha":"6584ebdcfb05b8f356213d1d2cb356cc0084ae5e"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:29:28.245Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69564524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JarrodJackson98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JarrodJackson98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JarrodJackson98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JarrodJackson98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JarrodJackson98","id":69564524,"login":"JarrodJackson98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTY0NTI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JarrodJackson98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JarrodJackson98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JarrodJackson98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JarrodJackson98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JarrodJackson98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JarrodJackson98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/sia-local-control-ui/commits/e87e8265025dc0337cefac48d49af21df80859c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:14:35Z","email":"69564524+JarrodJackson98@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JarrodJackson98"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:14:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Calibrate against the run''s average commanded rate when the VSD start boost ran (#5)\n\nThe controller''s new start boost (sia-injection-controller, start_boost_*)\nruns the first seconds of a low-rate start at a higher speed, so a boosted\n1-minute calibration test delivers more than test rate x time. Comparing\nthat volume against the test rate would make the new factor too low (about\n12 % for a test at 20 % of max).\n\nThe controller now publishes TestRunNominalRate, the run''s average commanded\nrate. The wizard reads it (test_run.nominal_rate, streamed in the cloud) and\ncomputeCalibration compares the delivered volume against it when present;\nan older controller, or an unboosted run, behaves exactly as before. The\nresults page shows the rate used as the target and, when the boost ran,\nsays the first seconds ran faster than the test rate.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0138AFJWs8mLc6YF5SDseHvu\n\nCo-authored-by: Jarrod <jarrod@span-eng.com>","tree":{"sha":"94c2d2bf27de306103c9878bff83d2d5d2836a5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/sia-local-control-ui/git/trees/94c2d2bf27de306103c9878bff83d2d5d2836a5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/sia-local-control-ui/git/commits/e87e8265025dc0337cefac48d49af21df80859c8","verification":{"payload":"tree 94c2d2bf27de306103c9878bff83d2d5d2836a5d\nparent 0b829feebc3b7d92e118cd745eadaf5f008bac78\nauthor JarrodJackson98 <69564524+JarrodJackson98@users.noreply.github.com> 1791422075 +1000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791422075 +1000\n\nCalibrate against the run''s average commanded rate when the VSD start boost ran (#5)\n\nThe controller''s new start boost (sia-injection-controller, start_boost_*)\nruns the first seconds of a low-rate start at a higher speed, so a boosted\n1-minute calibration test delivers more than test rate x time. Comparing\nthat volume against the test rate would make the new factor too low (about\n12 % for a test at 20 % of max).\n\nThe controller now publishes TestRunNominalRate, the run''s average commanded\nrate. The wizard reads it (test_run.nominal_rate, streamed in the cloud) and\ncomputeCalibration compares the delivered volume against it when present;\nan older controller, or an unboosted run, behaves exactly as before. The\nresults page shows the rate used as the target and, when the boost ran,\nsays the first seconds ran faster than the test rate.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0138AFJWs8mLc6YF5SDseHvu\n\nCo-authored-by: Jarrod <jarrod@span-eng.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxu57CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArh4QAH72IXeKuIj+bMcWmSNLwAdb\nY7uJQVG0or17ka9QRO6YGO8OPs2uWkPGfCw4VaMA+I340c0No0tcogcgoSL4QlCY\nyp5KvTHxLhJC6X9oxz+f87FwYxVyoK80NAnBlrzUKAXTqZBo4h8x6UhLIOHE5bLw\nz02abLjuadWrDgDn67/texPZHTBz7EctVLvCsdNC2CCcNtAp7WrAfUSZhjJj/kyK\nJ33Zcr58P2q/Ohr/bCLBnbCLuSyUhvfAtRv7SmCyj+vxmfavbipaECwqZaBUiJUU\n/5vnblbBC9x/d7cOIkmZKEKUMXPdRjG9hnUGP0mU3Qgyws2e1wiryKRnwhNKXjwc\nEhMKCelm9C47OoVerjsVyjK1C+8EQTKYM+YRpF4EFLV5bkzOmght8t1Fo0L9UXIO\n5/BA6lWd5ZWYdJiMpyLdCkXRTy8KSkTSUF8sM+OiIt0rWgxcHNDQrjZuLQDExioI\n5ZlMjdsYbWnEn3u/HJdOVna1nYVpMb0Bj3WJjaURsVBAIo0R1kVgHia13bUJXcFI\n2mg0ob3PPMoYj+smmeLQ/A6Bkt7G+VajlJNdWCEZ1yrDo7hQh3FFJBVIQu0QTeQJ\n+A8AUqD6WBAKrr/6