job that publishes the selected ref as\n<next patch>-<tag>.<run number> under an npm dist-tag (default alpha)\nvia OIDC. The version bump is not committed or tagged, so the release\nfrom main still derives its version from conventional commits.\n\nAmp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-01a0b266-070f-7649-a6e9-d01ce1c19446\nCo-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad899ce59789387689d2839afe989a514d1194de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/trees/ad899ce59789387689d2839afe989a514d1194de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/commits/8ab1b7c990f6e1feffc7952b62755d9e37b20fe5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/8ab1b7c990f6e1feffc7952b62755d9e37b20fe5","node_id":"C_kwDOP4y8dtoAKDhhYjFiN2M5OTBmNmUxZmVmZmM3OTUyYjYyNzU1ZDllMzdiMjBmZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/18bd700a0db3d0311348c07266049fa6ef2fe1a6","sha":"18bd700a0db3d0311348c07266049fa6ef2fe1a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/18bd700a0db3d0311348c07266049fa6ef2fe1a6"}],"sha":"8ab1b7c990f6e1feffc7952b62755d9e37b20fe5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/8ab1b7c990f6e1feffc7952b62755d9e37b20fe5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/18bd700a0db3d0311348c07266049fa6ef2fe1a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T03:33:43Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T03:33:43Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"message":"test(examples): ✅ cover shared sub-path and CJS require in react-vite\n\nAdd a zustand-shaped store-lib fixture (ESM root, ./traditional sub-path\nentry, and a CJS with-selector that require()s react) shared between the\nreact-vite host and remote. The remote button asserts that both paths\nreceive the host''s React instance and the spec checks for page errors.\n\nThe spec is renamed to match the serve e2e glob (it was never picked\nup), the nested pnpm-workspace.yaml is removed so the example is part of\nthe root workspace, and dedupeInjectedDeps is disabled so the injected\nfixture is installed as a real node_modules copy.\n\nAmp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-01a0b266-070f-7649-a6e9-d01ce1c19446\nCo-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfd4eebf8ef7368bbd9b1aae59c2f479af61acd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/trees/dfd4eebf8ef7368bbd9b1aae59c2f479af61acd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/commits/18bd700a0db3d0311348c07266049fa6ef2fe1a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/18bd700a0db3d0311348c07266049fa6ef2fe1a6","node_id":"C_kwDOP4y8dtoAKDE4YmQ3MDBhMGRiM2QwMzExMzQ4YzA3MjY2MDQ5ZmE2ZWYyZmUxYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/83e8b30191bde2fadd05ee8b1d8a2b9c49cd41c7","sha":"83e8b30191bde2fadd05ee8b1d8a2b9c49cd41c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/83e8b30191bde2fadd05ee8b1d8a2b9c49cd41c7"}],"sha":"18bd700a0db3d0311348c07266049fa6ef2fe1a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/18bd700a0db3d0311348c07266049fa6ef2fe1a6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/83e8b30191bde2fadd05ee8b1d8a2b9c49cd41c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T03:33:34Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T03:33:34Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"message":"fix(remote): 🐛 route CJS require() of shared modules to the host instance\n\nThe prod transform only rewrote ESM import declarations, so CJS\ndependencies such as use-sync-external-store (pulled in by zustand)\nstill require(''react'') from the remote''s bundled copy.\n\nAdd an enforce:''pre'' resolver that, for require-call resolutions of a\nshared module name, returns a CJS shim reading the already-loaded shared\ninstance (importSharedSync) and falling back to the local copy for\nstandalone use. The remote entry now preloads all shared modules in\ninit() and get() awaits that, so synchronous consumers see the host\ninstance.\n\nAmp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-01a0b266-070f-7649-a6e9-d01ce1c19446\nCo-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fc9ad85022ef8b10cdd34b4ae03ab25cb5c881f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/trees/7fc9ad85022ef8b10cdd34b4ae03ab25cb5c881f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/commits/83e8b30191bde2fadd05ee8b1d8a2b9c49cd41c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/83e8b30191bde2fadd05ee8b1d8a2b9c49cd41c7","node_id":"C_kwDOP4y8dtoAKDgzZThiMzAxOTFiZGUyZmFkZDA1ZWU4YjFkOGEyYjljNDljZDQxYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/bceffa11ae86d7c35fbd943d39d3d852e05872a2","sha":"bceffa11ae86d7c35fbd943d39d3d852e05872a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/bceffa11ae86d7c35fbd943d39d3d852e05872a2"}],"sha":"83e8b30191bde2fadd05ee8b1d8a2b9c49cd41c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/83e8b30191bde2fadd05ee8b1d8a2b9c49cd41c7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/bceffa11ae86d7c35fbd943d39d3d852e05872a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T03:33:34Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T03:33:34Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"message":"fix(remote): 🐛 rewrite shared imports inside shared package sub-path entries\n\nFiles under a shared package''s own node_modules directory (e.g.\nzustand/traditional, which is bundled into the remote) were skipped\nentirely, so their imports of other shared modules such as react stayed\nbound to the remote''s local copy and produced a second React instance.\nOnly imports of the owning package itself are now left untouched.\n\nAmp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-01a0b266-070f-7649-a6e9-d01ce1c19446\nCo-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>","tree":{"sha":"82e5ccfd371b5181f637a2643a115182b1d9b2f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/trees/82e5ccfd371b5181f637a2643a115182b1d9b2f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/commits/bceffa11ae86d7c35fbd943d39d3d852e05872a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/bceffa11ae86d7c35fbd943d39d3d852e05872a2","node_id":"C_kwDOP4y8dtoAKGJjZWZmYTExYWU4NmQ3YzM1ZmJkOTQzZDM5ZDNkODUyZTA1ODcyYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/7f9e11da28bc5dadcabfbd2a8e4f7b5f98d17dfa","sha":"7f9e11da28bc5dadcabfbd2a8e4f7b5f98d17dfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/7f9e11da28bc5dadcabfbd2a8e4f7b5f98d17dfa"}],"sha":"bceffa11ae86d7c35fbd943d39d3d852e05872a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/bceffa11ae86d7c35fbd943d39d3d852e05872a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/priv