ate":"2026-03-27T16:17:51Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T16:17:51Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"message":"refactor: overhaul e2e test infrastructure and bump to Node 24\n\n- Deduplicate vitestSetup-serve/dev into shared helper (vitestSetup-shared.ts)\n- Replace fs-extra with native Node 24 fs (node:fs/promises)\n- Convert function declarations to arrow functions\n- Extract hardcoded port 5000 into DEFAULT_PORT constant\n- Fix dev mode incorrectly setting NODE_ENV=production\n- Remove stale jest comment and dead vue2-demo check\n- Bump Node engine to >=24.0.0 and build/oxc targets to node24\n- Drop Node 22 from CI matrix, update lint job to Node 24\n- Remove fs-extra from devDependencies and regenerate lockfile\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Minimum Node.js version is now 24.\n\nAmp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-019d3011-f87a-76bf-b07b-7ebba2ccc677\nCo-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>","tree":{"sha":"2977c8392daad29053bcfcb3907d9265f3a1d235","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/trees/2977c8392daad29053bcfcb3907d9265f3a1d235"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/commits/08f93e542e2c7891d75807532a4bfe474ad89faf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/08f93e542e2c7891d75807532a4bfe474ad89faf","node_id":"C_kwDOP4y8dtoAKDA4ZjkzZTU0MmUyYzc4OTFkNzU4MDc1MzJhNGJmZTQ3NGFkODlmYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/08a8cf93dace1391d8898d2d68a79da1211ddb01","sha":"08a8cf93dace1391d8898d2d68a79da1211ddb01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/08a8cf93dace1391d8898d2d68a79da1211ddb01"}],"sha":"08f93e542e2c7891d75807532a4bfe474ad89faf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/08f93e542e2c7891d75807532a4bfe474ad89faf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/08a8cf93dace1391d8898d2d68a79da1211ddb01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T16:09:49Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T16:09:49Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"message":"feat!: v2.0 — overhaul dev-mode federation architecture\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Dev-mode shared module strategy completely reworked.\nRequires Vite 8+ with Rolldown for shared module pre-bundling in dev.\nPlugin name prefix changed to constant (PLUGIN_PREFIX). All rollup\ntype imports replaced with vite/rolldown equivalents.\n\nAmp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-019d2fbd-d197-71ab-b263-d93dd236124e\nCo-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e62304cbf745fcb1c4282ad2fec548301a49fe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/trees/6e62304cbf745fcb1c4282ad2fec548301a49fe0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/commits/08a8cf93dace1391d8898d2d68a79da1211ddb01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/08a8cf93dace1391d8898d2d68a79da1211ddb01","node_id":"C_kwDOP4y8dtoAKDA4YThjZjkzZGFjZTEzOTFkODg5OGQyZDY4YTc5ZGExMjExZGRiMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/0431418f51b01cea767e97e6d690a9e239e1003a","sha":"0431418f51b01cea767e97e6d690a9e239e1003a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/0431418f51b01cea767e97e6d690a9e239e1003a"}],"sha":"08a8cf93dace1391d8898d2d68a79da1211ddb01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/08a8cf93dace1391d8898d2d68a79da1211ddb01"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/0431418f51b01cea767e97e6d690a9e239e1003a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T16:07:15Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T16:07:15Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"message":"fix: filter non-importable sub-paths from shared module discovery\n\nSkip sub-paths that aren''t browser code modules: .json, .css, server-only\n(.node, .edge), /internal, /profiling, /test-utils, /static. These were\nbeing added to the shared set but couldn''t be pre-bundled, and caused\nreadFileSync crashes when the shared resolver intercepted package.json\nimports (virtual IDs contain null bytes that fs rejects).","tree":{"sha":"6e62304cbf745fcb1c4282ad2fec548301a49fe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/trees/6e62304cbf745fcb1c4282ad2fec548301a49fe0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/commits/0431418f51b01cea767e97e6d690a9e239e1003a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/0431418f51b01cea767e97e6d690a9e239e1003a","node_id":"C_kwDOP4y8dtoAKDA0MzE0MThmNTFiMDFjZWE3NjdlOTdlNmQ2OTBhOWUyMzllMTAwM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/d9bd4db7f82a991cc51e701cb6114e7058f43563","sha":"d9bd4db7f82a991cc51e701cb6114e7058f43563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/d9bd4db7f82a991cc51e701cb6114e7058f43563"}],"sha":"0431418f51b01cea767e97e6d690a9e239e1003a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/0431418f51b01cea767e97e6d690a9e239e1003a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/d9bd4db7f82a991cc51e701cb6114e7058f43563/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T16:04:36Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T16:04:36Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"message":"refactor: enable semicolons, extract init helper, deduplicate preamble\n\n- Enable semicolons in prettier config and format all .ts files\n- Add semicolons to all metacode inside template literals\n- Extract __federation_initRemote() helper in runtime template,\n  deduplicating the remote init pattern between var and esm branches\n- Simplify esm branch from nested Promise callbacks to async/await\n- Replace buildFederationImportPreamble with applyFederationImportPreamble\n  that handles the full preamble application (overwrite + prepend),\n  removing duplicated 5-line blocks from both dev and prod callers\n- Convert remaining function declarations in metacode to arrow functions\n  (merge, __federation_import in prod extraPreludeCode)\n\nAmp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-019d2fbd-d197-71ab-b263-d93dd236124e\nCo-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>","tree":{"sha":"f86ebf6f0507d3cc6a0e75c6a770943fc9a01291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/trees/f86ebf6f0507d3cc6a0e75c6a770943fc9a01291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/commits/d9bd4db7f82a991cc51e701cb6114e7058f43563","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/d9bd4db7f82a991cc51e701cb6114e7058f43563","node_id":"C_kwDOP4y8dtoAKGQ5YmQ0ZGI3ZjgyYTk5MWNjNTFlNzAxY2I2MTE0ZTcwNThmNDM1NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/13762e1ec104ccf9d3c6bce90c673d349acb5824","sha":"13762e1ec104ccf9d3c6bce90c673d349acb5824","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/13762e1ec104ccf9d3c6bce90c673d349acb5824"}],"sha":"d9bd4db7f82a991cc51e701cb6114e7058f43563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/d9bd4db7f82a991cc51e701cb6114e7058f43563"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/13762e1ec104ccf9d3c6bce90c673d349acb5824/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T15:58:30Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T15:58:30Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"message":"refactor: split constants into semantic groups, move utils to proper home\n\nConstants reorganized into src/constants/:\n- plugin.ts: PLUGIN_PREFIX, DEFAULT_ENTRY_FILENAME, SHARED, ROLLUP, VITE\n- virtual-modules.ts: VIRTUAL_FEDERATION, VIRTUAL_FN_IMPORT, etc.\n- runtime.ts: DYNAMIC_LOADING_CSS, FEDERATION_EXPOSE_PREFIX, CJS_EXPORTS_RE, etc.\n- index.ts: barrel re-export\n\npublic.ts now only contains mutable shared state (builderInfo,\nparsedOptions, devRemotes, etc.) and re-exports constants for compat.\n\nUtilities moved to src/utils/:\n- toJsArrayLiteral (was in public.ts)\n- joinUrlSegments, toOutputFilePathWithoutRuntime (were in remote-production.ts)\n- matchesUrl, sendJs (were duplicated in both dev files)","tree":{"sha":"6a8e9ba97076d30950f837b909b8f53adf8e3900","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/trees/6a8e9ba97076d30950f837b909b8f53adf8e3900"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/commits/13762e1ec104ccf9d3c6bce90c673d349acb5824","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/13762e1ec104ccf9d3c6bce90c673d349acb5824","node_id":"C_kwDOP4y8dtoAKDEzNzYyZTFlYzEwNGNjZjlkM2M2YmNlOTBjNjczZDM0OWFjYjU4MjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/182f2d4b802119a22e37acc5ad50e8e11e5f9372","sha":"182f2d4b802119a22e37acc5ad50e8e11e5f9372","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/182f2d4b802119a22e37acc5ad50e8e11e5f9372"}],"sha":"13762e1ec104ccf9d3c6bce90c673d349acb5824","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/13762e1ec104ccf9d3c6bce90c673d349acb5824"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/182f2d4b802119a22e37acc5ad50e8e11e5f9372/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T15:52:47Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T15:52:47Z","email":"hugo.burton@westpac.com.au","name":"Hugo Burton"},"message":"refactor: add sendJs/matchesUrl helpers, use template literal for metacode\n\n- Add sendJs() helper replacing 6 repeated setHeader+end patterns\n- Add matchesUrl() helper replacing 5 url===X||url?.startsWith(X+''?'')\n- Convert react-refresh singleton patch from string concatenation to\n  readable template literal\n- Both helpers defined in expose-development.ts and remote-development.ts","tree":{"sha":"69f9261f621d1489a2aae1fc08efb601c4cf86b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/trees/69f9261f621d1489a2aae1fc08efb601c4cf86b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/git/commits/182f2d4b802119a22e37acc5ad50e8e11e5f9372","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/182f2d4b802119a22e37acc5ad50e8e11e5f9372","node_id":"C_kwDOP4y8dtoAKDE4MmYyZDRiODAyMTE5YTIyZTM3YWNjNWFkNTBlOGUxMWU1ZjkzNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commit/12107ca22b6f51887c295f267e23b123299b952c","sha":"12107ca22b6f51887c295f267e23b123299b952c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hugs7/vite-plugin-federation/commits/12107ca22b6f51887c295f267e23b123299b952c"}