lad51 <67849897+Gallad51@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: add comprehensive CI/CD and deployment documentation\n\n- Create detailed DEPLOYMENT.md with step-by-step instructions\n- Document GCP prerequisites and setup\n- Add GitHub Actions configuration guide\n- Include complete environment variables reference\n- Add CI/CD workflow explanation and customization guide\n- Document manual deployment options\n- Include troubleshooting section and common issues\n- Update README.md with Deployment and CI/CD sections\n- Link to deployment guide from root README\n\nCo-authored-by: Gallad51 <67849897+Gallad51@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: integrate backend deployment with Terraform and document GitHub Actions variables\n\n- Create backend.tf with complete backend infrastructure configuration\n- Add backend-specific variables to variables.tf (secrets, resources, config)\n- Update outputs.tf with backend-specific outputs (health check, API docs URLs)\n- Create terraform.tfvars examples for preview and production environments\n- Create comprehensive GITHUB_ACTIONS_VARIABLES.md guide\n- Update DEPLOYMENT.md with Terraform integration section\n- Update infra/README.md with detailed backend configuration documentation\n- Document all required GitHub secrets and repository variables\n- Provide complete variable mapping between GitHub Actions and Terraform\n\nCo-authored-by: Gallad51 <67849897+Gallad51@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: integrate GitHub Actions workflows with Terraform infrastructure\n\n- Update pr-preview.yml to use Terraform for infrastructure provisioning\n- Update pr-cleanup.yml to use Terraform destroy for cleanup\n- Add Terraform setup step (v1.6.0) to both workflows\n- Pass all required variables to Terraform (project_id, region, service_name, environment)\n- Use environment variables for sensitive Terraform variables (TF_VAR_*)\n- Get service URLs from Terraform outputs instead of gcloud\n- Remove manual gcloud deploy commands in favor of Terraform\n- Add comprehensive Terraform Integration section to GITHUB_ACTIONS_VARIABLES.md\n- Document complete variable flow (GitHub → Terraform)\n- Add workflow overview and configuration examples\n- Update DEPLOYMENT.md CI/CD section with Terraform integration details\n- Document preview vs production deployment differences\n\nCo-authored-by: Gallad51 <67849897+Gallad51@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: resolve Terraform resource conflict between main.tf and backend.tf\n\n- Remove duplicate backend service from main.tf (conflicts with backend.tf)\n- backend.tf defines google_cloud_run_service.backend_api with full config\n- main.tf was creating google_cloud_run_service.backend with same name\n- Keep only backend_api resource which has comprehensive configuration\n- Remove backend_noauth IAM from main.tf (already in backend.tf)\n- Update infra/README.md import command to use backend_api resource\n- This fixes terraform plan failures due to duplicate resource definitions\n\nCo-authored-by: Gallad51 <67849897+Gallad51@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: resolve Terraform deprecation warnings and sensitive value errors\n\n- Replace deprecated ''automatic = true'' with ''auto {}'' in all secret replication blocks (backend.tf)\n- Remove unused ''secrets'' variable resources from main.tf (api_keys secret and version)\n- Secrets are now fully managed in backend.tf with proper configuration\n- Fix \"sensitive value in for_each\" error by removing var.secrets iteration\n- All 4 deprecation warnings resolved (jwt_secret, ctp_project_key, ctp_client_id, ctp_client_secret)\n- Terraform plan should now succeed without warnings or errors\n\nCo-authored-by: Gallad51 <67849897+Gallad51@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove explicit port declaration from backend Cloud Run service\n\n- Remove ports block from backend_api service in backend.tf\n- Cloud Run automatically detects port from PORT environment variable (8080)\n- Explicit port declaration is redundant and can cause issues\n- Follow Cloud Run best practices for port configuration\n\nCo-authored-by: Gallad51 <67849897+Gallad51@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove ports\n\n* fix: remove PORT environment variable from frontend Cloud Run service\n\n* Update test urls\n\n* Adding back timeouts\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Gallad51 <67849897+Gallad51@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo3RiwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5xMQAELw0dLXVqVZwdOkcLNcROdV\nn/+SuGme2D8K1/5E+ub6hlnXtDuuhvdGZd7cQoknLHj/HpPea/ZhZQq1wXi41jjB\ncYG3Zd4LZCowHztm8ttNTqFWon0CG2j9OmfMlbnpRxdmm3QotN9b2mkLMPGj5Irh\nUiD3RHb076eP8UtoG1C+Vf9PHkE1+rt3SF8U7DYCzuKXaOpKQe1V8Rl8Jddu+iwn\nPf8vKzO8i+kstPrhFdBPyV1IXjWsV0SuSYs6nIr+rVAtvEQ/kBD3oNnU9qSBhFfb\nmlEcLqcvIhF3X0Rql5/erNSaA6HWEnCDDYnBPRHBwP8uLCiZ3HvxVVfJ4t13ws9e\nT5pLG6Cp8elOO/HuW8VlHSBW1v7D/kuMk+gVy+1g3WhiYdSRTkYcTD6s4JwoLpwE\n9so4doHVeYUU+hwjGtRAcakdcSAublQ2YPJ/rhGOGYXbZ2ftZGMytQ13XRLicTYh\ngW6fN1umqy3jbrBr5nHqplwSXdZM7hGD5Q+PEoBFJJ3TcfIO8t4NCbb+t1JNkK4l\np2EGjgK0oX12oqvnCq4caZcUPr7mrsO9VYi69MLebPJ0sXae9JD1XVIk4IRIFnNt\ng9mZ2v5s5ETL4Jrpc9gsRWg4aZvOXD7Qsjn30BxBaq19+haIsycQF/cVO70VcbzV\nxBo32MqCHfW9HXh3z+Ua\n=9KNv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-01T12:04:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https:/