api.github.com/users/swansrp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/commits/a4f8d29c193b2f9e6b0ed5dab80f8181e3b6cee8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T01:13:10Z","email":"56093273@qq.com","name":"swansrp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:09:15Z","email":"56093273@qq.com","name":"swansrp"},"message":"feat(network): request() 增可选第 7 参 headers——按请求覆写/删除全局注入头（向后兼容加法）\n\n- request(path, method, query, body, config, signal, headers?)：非空值＝显式设置（provider 注入不覆盖），空值(null/空串)键记入 omitHeaderKeys 由拦截器删除\n- 拦截器对已显式携带的头跳过 provider 覆盖（if (config.headers[key] !== undefined) return）\n- 不传第 7 参时行为与既往逐位一致（既有调用零回归）\n- 动机：InkHub 跨空间运营页需在不带 X-Space-Id 的场合清掉全局空间头（后端 TenantLine 无上下文即跨空间读）；业务侧无法自改 provider，管道能力归框架\n- 推送前待用户 review","tree":{"sha":"33a86c32a8bd36fce7f5ddca1f31502b78c4f8df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/git/trees/33a86c32a8bd36fce7f5ddca1f31502b78c4f8df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/git/commits/a4f8d29c193b2f9e6b0ed5dab80f8181e3b6cee8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34997734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/swansrp","id":34997734,"login":"swansrp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk3NzM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://a