ithub.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/commits/9485b3f6fb84dbd32220a48844a6b96ea232ea43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:43:07Z","email":"56093273@qq.com","name":"swansrp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:17:30Z","email":"56093273@qq.com","name":"swansrp"},"message":"feat(router): 静态路由 keep-alive 接口——createStaticRoutes 增 keepAliveName 参，收集到 getStaticKeepAliveNames() 供业务层根 App.vue <keep-alive :include> 消费\n\n框架自带 keep-alive 只在 MainContent 壳内（:include 按菜单节点 isCache 收集），createStaticRoutes 注册的顶级整页路由由根 router-view 渲染、在壳外，菜单缓存管不到（InkHub /ask 跳 /preview 返回组件重挂载、会话态清零，2026-09-24 用户实测暴露）。\n\n接口约定：include 按组件名匹配，SFC 默认 __name 均为 ''index'' 多页撞名，须 defineOptions({ name }) 显式命名与 keepAliveName 一致；DEV 下注册时异步解析真实组件名比对，不一致 console.warn 提示（防静默失效）。未消费该列表的项目零变化（纯加法）。","tree":{"sha":"664622bf772c4f92a04d5161130a97fcd8615708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/git/trees/664622bf772c4f92a04d5161130a97fcd8615708"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/git/commits/9485b3f6fb84dbd32220a48844a6b96ea232ea43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34997734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/swansrp","id":34997734,"login":"swansrp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk3NzM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/swansrp/vue3-framework/commit/9485b3f6fb84dbd32220a48844a6b96ea232ea43","node_id":"C_kwDOP50KR9oAKDk0ODViM2Y2ZmI4NGRiZDMyMjIwYTQ4ODQ0YTZiOTZlYTIzMmVhNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/swansrp/vue3-framework/commit/a6325c641d3afdab8dd1113f0b0caa75a7528d25","sha":"a6325c641d3afdab8dd1113f0b0caa75a7528d25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/commits/a6325c641d3afdab8dd1113f0b0caa75a7528d25"}],"sha":"9485b3f6fb84dbd32220a48844a6b96ea232ea43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/commits/9485b3f6fb84dbd32220a48844a6b96ea232ea43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34997734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/swansrp","id":34997734,"login":"swansrp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk3NzM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/commits/a6325c641d3afdab8dd1113f0b0caa75a7528d25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T10:47:54Z","email":"56093273@qq.com","name":"swansrp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:17:20Z","email":"56093273@qq.com","name":"swansrp"},"message":"feat(router): 登录门禁上收框架——configureLoginGuard（opt-in）\n\n为什么：vue-router 在 app.use(router)（install）时就发起首次导航，并同步采集\n那一刻已有的守卫队列——各项目在 main.ts 里晚注册的登录守卫不参与首屏导航，\n表现为\"会话过期时首屏白屏：既不渲染也不跳登录页\"（2026-09-22 实测；InkHub\n与脚手架模板当初均为 install 后才注册，同错序）。\n\n做法：守卫在 router 模块加载处（createRouter 之后）即注册，必然参与包括首屏\n在内的每一次导航，\"注册顺序\"从此不再是调用方要记住的约束。configureLoginGuard\n只设置策略对象；未调用时守卫直接放行（opt-in，现有项目零变化）。\n\n框架统一持有：单飞探活（并发导航共用一次）/ 探活超时（默认 8s，悬挂不能卡死\n守卫）/ 连续失败封顶（默认 3，防\"守卫↔登录页\"紧循环打接口）/ 公开路由判定 /\n跳登录 / 登录态下 enterDynamicRoute / SSO 回跳参数 id_token 剥除。\n\n业务侧（main.ts）只声明策略：\n  configureLoginGuard({ isLoggedIn, probe, onAuthenticated?, loginEntry?, loginPath?, isPublic? })\n\n实测（自动化浏览器）：有效会话冷加载 / 渲染工作台（1 次探活）；失效会话直开\n受保护路由 → 落 /login 且渲染、探活 3 次封顶；有效会话直开受保护路由 → 正常渲染。","tree":{"sha":"ab2b690212184035fefe073e50bbb25677fd7297","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/git/trees/ab2b690212184035fefe073e50bbb25677fd7297"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/git/commits/a6325c641d3afdab8dd1113f0b0caa75a7528d25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34997734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/swansrp","id":34997734,"login":"swansrp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk3NzM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/subscriptions","type":"User","