XNlcjM0OTk3NzM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/commits/0805c789defa065552ea4e6927527dfc578026d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:21:12Z","email":"56093273@qq.com","name":"swansrp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:21:12Z","email":"56093273@qq.com","name":"swansrp"},"message":"feat(network): 暴露业务请求头注入点 setRequestHeaderProvider\n\n动机：业务需要为每个请求附加自己的头（如项目空间隔离头 X-Space-Id），而 axios 实例\n与拦截器都在框架内部，业务无法干预。按\"机制进框架、语义留业务\"加一个注入点：\n业务在 main.ts 注册 provider（通常读 pinia store / localStorage），框架每次请求时调用、\n合并进 headers 并剔除空值键——框架不解释任何业务头语义。\n\n- 新增导出 setRequestHeaderProvider(provider | null) 与类型 RequestHeaderProvider\n- 请求拦截器在 Authorization 之后合并附加头（空值跳过，避免把空串发出去）\n- 纯增量：不注册 provider 时行为与改动前完全一致，既有调用方零影响","tree":{"sha":"65d8c0b58c0e63688f379b241856283ecbeb990b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/git/trees/65d8c0b58c0e63688f379b241856283ecbeb990b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/swansrp/vue3-framework/git/commits/0805c789defa065552ea4e6927527dfc578026d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34997734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swansrp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":