rs.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/commits/51f17ac616fb494e59a5451d995f975369a0b26a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:30:35Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matthaeus Wolff"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:30:35Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matthaeus Wolff"},"message":"chore(devvault): declare HADOKU_NPM_READ_TOKEN for the service key [skip ci]\n\nCI moves to reading the registry token from the vault at job time\n(hadoku-actions setup-pnpm vault-key). The grant is derived from this\ndeclaration by hadoku_site''s sync-service-acl.mjs.","tree":{"sha":"a5502405e74515fb971ebfbb894456c2a1c818b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/git/trees/a5502405e74515fb971ebfbb894456c2a1c818b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/git/commits/51f17ac616fb494e59a5451d995f975369a0b26a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-task/commit/51f17ac616fb494e59a5451d995f975369a0b26a","node_id":"C_kwDOP50_wNoAKDUxZjE3YWM2MTZmYjQ5NGU1OWE1NDUxZDk5NWY5NzUzNjlhMGIyNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-task/commit/3c902c85782286ec9529c2d11b309618d67f53ae","sha":"3c902c85782286ec9529c2d11b309618d67f53ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/commits/3c902c85782286ec9529c2d11b309618d67f53ae"}],"sha":"51f17ac616fb494e59a5451d995f975369a0b26a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/commits/51f17ac616fb494e59a5451d995f975369a0b26a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/commits/3c902c85782286ec9529c2d11b309618d67f53ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:36:50Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:36:50Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"themes: rework six dark themes for accent/background separation\n\nCoffee-dark reads best because its surfaces are nearly colorless (OKLCH chroma\n0.006) under a saturated accent: ~32x chroma contrast. Strawberry, lavender and\npink ran 5-7x because bg, card, border, primary, danger and muted text all sat\nwithin ~20 degrees of one hue.\n\nEach theme now takes a deliberate shape rather than one shared formula:\n- dark: graphite split. Slate drained to neutral so violet is the only color.\n  Danger moves to rose; it was #c084fc, 1 degree from primary and equal to\n  primary-dark, so delete buttons looked like primary buttons.\n- strawberry-dark: leaf. Green-black surfaces, leaf-green borders, berry red.\n- lavender-dark: twilight. Deep indigo room, borders equal bg-alt (ocean''s move).\n- pink-dark: rose. Dusty mauve with a light rose accent; card-on-bg was 1.07:1.\n- nature-dark: moss and bark. More saturated leaf, bark-brown borders.\n- izakaya-dark: sumi ink. Navy drained to ink so the teal carries; brown border kept.\n\nAll six now ramp -dark genuinely darker (four ran the button gradient upward),\ngive primary-bg a visible tint (several equalled bg-card), and retint focus\nshadows to the new primary. Values generated in OKLCH and finalised by\nderive.mjs; check-contrast passes 558 pairs.","tree":{"sha":"12de349dc6c24d67efe1154ed8a94203a2d55023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/git/trees/12de349dc6c24d67efe1154ed8a94203a2d55023"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/git/commits/3c902c85782286ec9529c2d11b309618d67f53ae","verification":{"payload":"tree 12de349dc6c24d67efe1154ed8a94203a2d55023\nparent 8ea8cf87d6b832993518e34663be94e1a51e0fcb\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791398210 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791398210 -0700\n\nthemes: rework six dark themes for accent/background separation\n\nCoffee-dark reads best because its surfaces are nearly colorless (OKLCH chroma\n0.006) under a saturated accent: ~32x chroma contrast. Strawberry, lavender and\npink ran 5-7x because bg, card, border, primary, danger and muted text all sat\nwithin ~20 degrees of one hue.\n\nEach theme now takes a deliberate shape rather than one shared formula:\n- dark: graphite split. Slate drained to neutral so violet is the only color.\n  Danger moves to rose; it was #c084fc, 1 degree from primary and equal to\n  primary-dark, so delete buttons looked like primary buttons.\n- strawberry-dark: leaf. Green-black surfaces, leaf-green borders, berry red.\n- lavender-dark: twilight. Deep indigo room, borders equal bg-alt (ocean''s move).\n- pink-dark: rose. Dusty mauve with a light rose accent; card-on-bg was 1.07:1.\n- nature-dark: moss and bark. More saturated leaf, bark-brown borders.\n- izakaya-dark: sumi ink. Navy drained to ink so the teal carries; brown border kept.\n\nAll six now ramp -dark genuinely darker (four ran the button gradient upward),\ngive primary-bg a visible tint (several equalled bg-card), and retint focus\nshadows to the new primary. Values generated in OKLCH and finalised by\nderive.mjs; check-contrast passes 558 pairs.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOkH0pju5M1MVJESh4gj8CNs2BaRw/L1zcK94mckPREXQb/5+5E28waujoWq7IlxNh\nRAsCosSJWcOeVCXBXwgAA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T18:37:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-task/commit/3c902c85782286ec9529c2d11b309618d67f53ae","node_id":"C_kwDOP50_wNoAKDNjOTAyYzg1NzgyMjg2ZWM5NTI5YzJkMTFiMzA5NjE4ZDY3ZjUzYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-task/commit/8ea8cf87d6b832993518e34663be94e1a51e0fcb","sha":"8ea8cf87d6b832993518e34663be94e1a51e0fcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/commits/8ea8cf87d6b832993518e34663be94e1a51e0fcb"}],"sha":"3c902c85782286ec9529c2d11b309618d67f53ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/commits/3c902c85782286ec9529c2d11b309618d67f53ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/commits/8ea8cf87d6b832993518e34663be94e1a51e0fcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:53:53Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:53:53Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"themes: set Zod jitless before themePrefs builds its schema\n\nConstructing a z.object runs Zod v4''s one-time allowsEval probe,\nnew Function(''''), and caches the answer. hadoku.me''s CSP grants no\n''unsafe-eval'', so every page that loads @wolffm/themes recorded a\nscript-src violation. Harmless at runtime (Zod falls back to its non-JIT\nparser), but a real violation, and it fails watchparty''s production CSP\nspec before its media and game checks run.\n\nThis module is evaluated before any app code, so only it can get ahead of\nthe probe; an app calling config() later is too late (tried in watchparty,\nverified ineffective). The config is on globalThis and shared by every Zod\ncopy. Verified: constructing a schema makes 2 Function calls without it,\n0 with it. Theme/prefs specs 27/27, full suite 167/167.\n\nCloses #93","tree":{"sha":"de75eca82adfbafa9dd0265f2c8c4c9fc9faef04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/git/trees/de75eca82adfbafa9dd0265f2c8c4c9fc9faef04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/git/commits/8ea8cf87d6b832993518e34663be94e1a51e0fcb","verification":{"payload":"tree de75eca82adfbafa9dd0265f2c8c4c9fc9faef04\nparent e9de191a194e1705f727de8338b55cbf3e6d8490\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791302033 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791302033 -0700\n\nthemes: set Zod jitless before themePrefs builds its schema\n\nConstructing a z.object runs Zod v4''s one-time allowsEval probe,\nnew Function(''''), and caches the answer. hadoku.me''s CSP grants no\n''unsafe-eval'', so every page that loads @wolffm/themes recorded a\nscript-src violation. Harmless at runtime (Zod falls back to its non-JIT\nparser), but a real violation, and it fails watchparty''s production CSP\nspec before its media and game checks run.\n\nThis module is evaluated before any app code, so only it can get ahead of\nthe probe; an app calling config() later is too late (tried in watchparty,\nverified ineffective). The config is on globalThis and shared by every Zod\ncopy. Verified: constructing a schema makes 2 Function calls without it,\n0 with it. Theme/prefs specs 27/27, full suite 167/167.\n\nCloses #93\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDE4NTv4eZu4ZJFGs65h61plW4N4tlUfz1C6z88lN1HEPLnqUP5f8Sy138VnR4r+je\nswjrOgQsws7zxWd/IaOgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T15:54:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/