e account can see. It was presented to\nnpm.pkg.github.com purely to install @wolffm packages, so a leak of it was an\naccount compromise rather than a nuisance.\n\nHADOKU_NPM_READ_TOKEN can only read packages. It is already seeded on this repo\n(22 repos, 44/44 verified) and its rotation entry enforces a scope CEILING, so it\ncannot silently regain write access at the next mint.\n\nOnly npm-auth references moved. Anything that pushes, checks out, or dispatches\nstill uses HADOKU_SITE_TOKEN and still needs repo scope.","tree":{"sha":"5f97a41f469218efa9ff6a22990c1330718f8bf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/git/trees/5f97a41f469218efa9ff6a22990c1330718f8bf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/git/commits/ebc458f81dc6bb4a752ecf38673dc4750eed75a6","verification":{"payload":"tree 5f97a41f469218efa9ff6a22990c1330718f8bf4\nparent 4626f291617677b575aa7bc37137b56c07181071\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1787167048 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1787167048 -0700\n\nci: authenticate npm installs with HADOKU_NPM_READ_TOKEN\n\nHADOKU_SITE_TOKEN carries repo + workflow — on a classic PAT that is read AND\nWRITE across every repo the account can see. It was presented to\nnpm.pkg.github.com purely to install @wolffm packages, so a leak of it was an\naccount compromise rather than a nuisance.\n\nHADOKU_NPM_READ_TOKEN can only read packages. It is already seeded on this repo\n(22 repos, 44/44 verified) and its rotation entry enforces a scope CEILING, so it\ncannot silently regain write access at the next mint.\n\nOnly npm-auth references moved. Anything that pushes, checks out, or dispatches\nstill uses HADOKU_SITE_TOKEN and still needs repo scope.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJiWciEhl4l6cJ7bVL+foc9B