{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/commits/f79674c8081487d2dee4588270b42da3450c9916/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:08:32Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:08:32Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"chore(vibecompact): record the handlers.ts fix stamp\n\nMachine-written by `vibecheck audit` at anchor 0da1ff1: size on\nsrc/domain/handlers/handlers.ts folds from firing to fixed, and none of the five\nmodules it was split into fires anything new.\n\nFour findings remain, all size, all deliberately open.","tree":{"sha":"0878d87e4e0bba6cc442683f3ebfaaa56ed95380","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/git/trees/0878d87e4e0bba6cc442683f3ebfaaa56ed95380"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-task/git/commits/f79674c8081487d2dee4588270b42da3450c9916","verification":{"payload":"tree 0878d87e4e0bba6cc442683f3ebfaaa56ed95380\nparent 0da1ff1c804ba49baedb3726764b1715f225f891\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1787094512 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1787094512 -0700\n\nchore(vibecompact): record the handlers.ts fix stamp\n\nMachine-written by `vibecheck audit` at anchor 0da1ff1: size on\nsrc/domain/handlers/handlers.ts folds from firing to fixed, and none of the five\nmodules it was split into fires anything new.\n\nFour findings remain, all size, all deliberately open.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHeMEctiVKpWIZD50XpcEbB+kdYZwl9gl3CAxuXPU5mjCu2Cq1jKQIuUi4M/ADw2sA\nQJ