"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/fcc2629aba89c60c97148ed27affe1985d2d5533","node_id":"C_kwDOP53cGNoAKGZjYzI2MjlhYmE4OWM2MGM5NzE0OGVkMjdhZmZlMTk4NWQyZDU1MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/c624b374eb2f11366a77b8909e29a6ba3d059a8a","sha":"c624b374eb2f11366a77b8909e29a6ba3d059a8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/c624b374eb2f11366a77b8909e29a6ba3d059a8a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/2586eeb046d79c97ee0ffa84d32b3598c446aad4","sha":"2586eeb046d79c97ee0ffa84d32b3598c446aad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/2586eeb046d79c97ee0ffa84d32b3598c446aad4"}],"sha":"fcc2629aba89c60c97148ed27affe1985d2d5533","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/fcc2629aba89c60c97148ed27affe1985d2d5533"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/2586eeb046d79c97ee0ffa84d32b3598c446aad4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:32:18Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:32:18Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(academics): a guardian link that matched nothing must not report success\n\nGranting a parent portal account is a two-step flow: the client creates the\naccount in Identity, then calls POST /academics/students/:id/link-guardian to\nrecord the resulting userId on the guardian. Step 1 has therefore already had a\nside effect by the time step 2 runs.\n\nlinkGuardianToUser matched on guardianId, fell back to a case-insensitive email\ncomparison, and on a miss logged a warning and returned. The controller responds\n{ linked: true } unconditionally, so the miss reached the operator as a success\nwhile the freshly created Cognito account was left with nothing referencing it.\nThe record kept whatever hasPortalAccess value it already had, producing the\nhasPortalAccess-true / userId-null inconsistency the frontend already has to\ndefend against.\n\nThe email fallback cannot rescue a stale guardianId for a guardian that has no\nemail, and an IEMIS-imported cohort has no guardian emails at all, so the miss\nis reachable in practice rather than theoretical.\n\nThe no-match branch now throws NotFoundException. The only internal caller,\nprovisionPortalAccounts, already wraps this in a try/catch that logs and\nswallows, so student creation keeps its graceful degradation and the change is\nconfined to the explicit grant endpoint — where the operator now sees the\nfailure instead of a false success.\n\nThe replaced warn log interpolated the guardian''s email address; that site is\none of those tracked for removal under #506 and goes away with it. The thrown\nmessage carries studentId and guardianId only.\n\nSpec covers both matching paths, the three no-match shapes including the\nemail-less imported case, and that no write is attempted on a miss. Verified by\nreverting the fix: the five no-match assertions fail, the matching-path\nassertions still pass.\n\nCloses #521","tree":{"sha":"671f6e0a6bec87aa349344da75e991077624d961","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/671f6e0a6bec87aa349344da75e991077624d961"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/2586eeb046d79c97ee0ffa84d32b3598c446aad4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"