78?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/2be996b3882cabbe59903dc8daa3e926d89de965/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:42:20Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:42:31Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(logger): stop logging emails, and stop collapsing structured logs to [object Object]\n\nBoth observed in production CloudWatch on 2026-09-25, on the deploy carrying\n#506A.\n\nPII — 16 log statements interpolated an email or a Cognito username, at INFO,\ninto log groups with 30-day retention. #506A fixed the JwtStrategy line; a\nsweep found 16 more across identity users/auth and the academics identity\nclient, including a STUDENT''s email on the role-assignment path. Every one now\nlogs the userId (or studentId) that was already in scope, so the diagnostic\nvalue is kept and the address is not.\n\n[object Object] — Nest''s LoggerService contract is (message: any, context?:\nstring) and both slots reached String(). 81 call sites pass a structured object\nas the MESSAGE ({ action: ''payment.manual_recorded'', ... }) and 17 pass one as\nthe CONTEXT; all of them logged nothing usable.\n\nThe intent at those sites is correct — they are structured-logging on purpose —\nso this is fixed once in StructuredLogger rather than at ~100 call sites. A new\nnormalizeLogInput promotes the action field (or an inner message field) to the\nreadable line, moves the remaining keys to metadata, and treats an object\ncontext as metadata rather than a label. String messages and string contexts\nare untouched, and error()''s Error-stack preservation is unchanged.\n\nThis had to land now rather than later: logEntry.message is built BEFORE\nJSON.stringify, so #506B''s switch to structured output does not rescue it — the\nJSON would carry \"message\": \"[object Object]\" permanently.\n\nA test pins that normalization cannot disturb the literal\niemis.audit.emit_failure token the compliance MetricFilter keys off.\n\nCloses #519","tree":{"sha":"d2fe0709c6f2eedebe5086858d0dc346d881e6cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/d2fe0709c6f2eedebe5086858d0dc346d881e6cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/2be996b3882cabbe59903dc8daa3e926d89de965","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibr