m","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"docs(deploys): grade-applicability deploy, plus the unrecorded #476 entry\n\nTwo sanitized entries. The 2026-09-22 one covers PR #478 (issue #477):\nbulk generation was writing every selected fee onto every student\nregardless of grade, because the grade check in generate() is gated on a\ngrade level neither bulk path passed. Deployed from the PR branch first\nand merged only after validation, at the operator''s direction.\n\nThe 2026-09-06 #476 entry backfills a deploy that went out and was\nverified but never recorded, so the timeline did not match the commit\nstamp running in production. Its validation line notes that the path\nrested on unit coverage at deploy time and was exercised with a real\nstaff token only during the 2026-09-22 pass.\n\nBoth pass `npm run lint:deploy-evidence`.","tree":{"sha":"9d495cee8cdcb38b10015a1488a86d8103a2a247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/9d495cee8cdcb38b10015a1488a86d8103a2a247"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/b61dbaf2cdc5af95aa297a3bca0a4daf55ba330d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/sta