/api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/b3df2b59d94ef01fb78cd40a8fc668dcb395fa71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T18:32:14Z","email":"shoaib.rain1@gmail.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T18:32:14Z","email":"shoaib.rain1@gmail.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(finance): staff invoice list forwards ?invoiceNumber= (#475)\n\nPR #473 shipped the GSI3 invoice-number lookup and wired it into the two\nparent/student branches of the controller, but both staff branches kept\npassing their options object without it. A Parent''s search was filtered\nand a Principal''s identical request returned the unfiltered list — the\nprivilege relationship inverted, on a feature built for staff.\n\n- controller: forward invoiceNumber to list() and listBySchoolAndGrade()\n- listBySchoolAndGrade: accept invoiceNumber and narrow inside the grade\n  partition. Routing to GSI3 here would silently drop the grade scope the\n  caller asked for, so it stays a begins_with filter on the GSI14 read,\n  which already goes through queryInvoicesFilled and cannot starve.\n- list(): reject studentId + invoiceNumber instead of ignoring the number.\n  That branch returns before the GSI3 lookup, so accepting both would hand\n  back the student''s unfiltered rows and call it a search. Mirrors the\n  billingSource guard directly above it.\n\nTests assert the parameter reaches the service on all three staff paths;\nall three fail against the previous controller. Service-level tests cover\nthe new grade-scoped filter and the rejected combination.","tree":{"sha":"888eb54c119de494a4d711302a4826b6d388e9da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/888eb54c119de494a4d711302a4826b6d388e9da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/b3df2b59d94ef01fb78cd40a8fc668dcb395fa71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/b3df2b59d94ef01fb78cd40a8fc668dcb395fa71","node_id":"C_kwDOP53cGNoAKGIzZGYyYjU5ZDk0ZWYwMWZiNzhjZDQwY