ibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/6ecb0996403e992a4321af33f0b5d9a5e970c5d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T10:27:46Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T10:27:46Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"docs(deploys): exception-filter deploy 2026-09-06 — prod green, 409 wire envelope validated","tree":{"sha":"887d6009c4ff8db636535e0d968564a3653719c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/887d6009c4ff8db636535e0d968564a3653719c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/6ecb0996403e992a4321af33f0b5d9a5e970c5d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/6ecb0996403e992a4321af33f0b5d9a5e970c5d8","node_id":"C_kwDOP53cGNoAKDZlY2IwOTk2NDAzZTk5MmE0MzIxYWYzM2YwYjVkOWE1ZTk3MGM1ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/70dd1e6253cff0ed13e9b535f8f0356ceca6bee7","sha":"70dd1e6253cff0ed13e9b535f8f0356ceca6bee7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/70dd1e6253cff0ed13e9b535f8f0356ceca6bee7"}],"sha":"6ecb0996403e992a4321af33f0b5d9a5e970c5d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/6ecb0996403e992a4321af33f0b5d9a5e970c5d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/70dd1e6253cff0ed13e9b535f8f0356ceca6bee7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T10:15:14Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T10:15:14Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(exceptions): forward domain error code and payload through GlobalExceptionFilter\n\nFinance throws `new ConflictException({ code: FinanceErrors.X, message,\n...payload })` at 65 sites (AGREEMENT_ACTIVE with agreementId /\nexistingInvoiceId, CONFLICTING_OPEN_INVOICES with conflicts[],\nAGREEMENT_OVERLAP with studentIds / conflictingAgreementId, ...). The\nfilter rebuilt every body from message / errorCode / details / errors\nonly, so clients received `{ statusCode, errorCode: ''CONFLICT'', message,\ntimestamp, requestId, path }` and nothing else. The family-billing UI\n(edforge-saas-frontend #331) branches on `code` and the payload, so the\nacknowledge-and-activate retry, the AGREEMENT_ACTIVE override dialog and\noverlap handling could never fire in a browser.\n\nPre-existing since the filter was written; not a Lambda regression. It\nwent unnoticed because the service specs assert getResponse() before the\nfilter and the frontend''s mocked E2E fixtures served the intended shape.\n\n- Emit `code` at top level when present and forward every non-envelope\n  key. Envelope fields are written last so a payload key can never\n  overwrite statusCode / timestamp / requestId / path. Nest''s own `error`\n  label on string-constructed exceptions is excluded, so the common\n  `{ statusCode, errorCode, message }` bodies are byte-identical.\n- ErrorResponseDto: `code?` plus an index signature for the payload.\n- New spec pins the wire shape for the three finance 409s and proves the\n  nestjs-zod 400, BusinessException, string-constructed and unknown-error\n  bodies are unchanged.\n- academic-years.internal.controller: comment only; the route is on\n  API-B behind the authorizer since cost-redesign Sprint 2.","tree":{"sha":"73b334c9