nizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/add52a4601a65963a7375ef268ff7eb564cad85b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T18:15:47Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T18:15:47Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"feat(cdk): tenant provisioner and deprovisioner functions on the SBT bus (C7.1, C7.2)\n\nTwo NodejsFunctions in controlplane-stack replace the CodeBuild script\njobs. They listen for sbt_aws_onboardingRequest / sbt_aws_offboardingRequest\nwith the source and detail types taken from the IEventManager instance and\nanswer with the script job''s exact envelopes, so SBT''s registration PATCH\nand the tenant seeder work unchanged.\n\nProvisioner: Cognito admin user (the attributes provision-tenant.sh set),\ntenant group, membership, the tenant alert topic with the admin subscribed,\nthen provisionSuccess with tenantConfig (pool, client, API-B URL) and\nalertTopicArn. Every step is create-if-missing so retries converge; a\npermanent refusal (non-BASIC tier) emits provisionFailure, alerts the\noperator and returns; other errors emit the failure and rethrow.\n\nDeprovisioner: default-deny — no METADATA row, no tenantTag or production\nis refused unless the request carries confirmProduction: true; otherwise it\ndeletes the group''s users, the group, the tenant partition in the three\ntables (batched, unprocessed keys retried) and the topic, then emits\ndeprovisionSuccess.\n\nThe seeder persists alertTopicArn from tenantData (D7.3); the control-plane\nfunctions alarm gains the two functions as terms (metric math, still one\nalarm); IAM is per action on the pool, the tenant stack, the tables, the\ntopics and the bus — no wildcard resource.","tree":{"sha":"b6479e5533872b8c13478154298865b0ac4d3a7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/b6479e5533872b8c13478154298865b0ac4d3a7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/add52a4601a65963a7375ef268ff7eb564cad85b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/add52a4601a65963a7375ef268ff7eb564cad85b","node_id":"C_kwDOP53cGNoAKGFkZDUyYTQ2MDFhNjU5NjNhNzM3NWVmMjY4ZmY3ZWI1NjRjYWQ4NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/14b6e3a202571800252b92091cdd4faa85f691ba","sha":"14b6e3a202571800252b92091cdd4faa85f691ba","url":"https://api.github.c