ers/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/75e5e61501f1da726f8ff39b671d2bccf229d196/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T17:01:09Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T17:01:09Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(analytics): aggregator ignores unmapped event types, retries transaction conflicts; alarm watches new dead letters (C8.1)\n\nedforge-analytics-functions-errors had been in ALARM since the Sprint 0\ndeploy with no function erroring. The aggregator dead-letters events itself:\nevery identity-service LoginSuccess (the Cognito post-authentication\ntrigger, unmapped since July) and the InvoiceGenerated bursts of a bulk\nrun that lost a DynamoDB TransactionConflict. The alarm summed the queue''s\ndepth, so it could not clear for 14 days after any of them.\n\n- edforge.identity-service::LoginSuccess maps to auth.login.success, the\n  metric the adoption report''s teacherLoginCadence reads.\n- An unmapped (source, detailType) is logged as ''event ignored'' and dropped;\n  the DLQ is for events that failed to be processed.\n- TransactWriteItems cancelled with TransactionConflict is retried up to\n  five times with jittered backoff (a cancelled transaction applied\n  nothing); other cancellations still dead-letter at once.\n- The alarm''s DLQ term is NumberOfMessagesSent over 15 minutes, not depth;\n  the dashboard keeps the depth graph.","tree":{"sha":"6b303f308ef4d873a13dd3a6ca245e5d7a41166d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/6b303f308ef4d873a13dd3a6ca245e5d7a41166d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/75e5e61501f1da726f8ff39b671d2bccf229d196","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/75e5e61501f1da726f8ff39b671d2bccf229d196","node_id":"C_kwDOP53cGNoAKDc1ZTVlNjE1MDFmMWRhNzI2ZjhmZjM5YjY3MWQyYmNjZjIyOWQxOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/d23ff15fe1b64c2013557c6db76208e41ef3b89a","sha":"d23ff15fe1b64c2013557c6db76208e41ef3b89a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/d23ff15fe1b64c2013557c6db76208e41ef3b89a"}],"sha":"75e5e61501f1da726f8ff39b671d2bccf229d196","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/75e5e61501f1da726f8ff39b671d2bccf229d196"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/d23ff15fe1b64c2013557c6db76208e41ef3b89a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T17:01:09Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T17:01:09Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"perf(jobs): janitors query a sparse running-jobs index (GSI15) every 15 minutes instead of scanning the tables (C8.8)\n\nThe finance and IEMIS job janitors ran a DynamoDB Scan with a status filter\nover their whole table every five minutes. A Scan is billed on bytes read,\nso the two sweeps were 91 % of the account''s DynamoDB reads (about $2 a\nmonth, linear in table size) for a handful of rows.\n\nGSI15 is a sparse index on the tenant tables: markRunning writes\ngsi15pk = RUNNING_JOB#<entityType>, gsi15sk = startedAt; every terminal\ntransition (succeeded, failed, sweeper, janitor) REMOVEs the keys, so the\nindex holds only running jobs. The janitors Query it with gsi15sk < cutoff,\ndrop the keys of a row whose status moved on without them, and sweep every\n15 minutes against 60/30-minute staleness thresholds. IAM narrows from\nScan on the table to Query on the index.","tree":{"sha":"18e416da7978d9edc81fcf7de65323fa3c60a531","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/18e416da7978d9edc81fcf7de65323fa3c60a531"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/d23ff15fe1b64c2013557c6db76208e41ef3b89a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/d23ff15fe1b64c2013557c6db76208e41ef3b89a","node_id":"C_kwDOP5