functions and one without the\nsecond would have silently disabled the timers. The functions, the API-B\ninvoke permission on the analytics function and the enabled schedules are\nunconditional now; scripts/deploy.sh builds the bundles for every deploy.\nFlag-less diffs against production: tenant-template only the commit-id\nstamp, analytics no differences. CLAUDE.md: route registration is two-way\nwith a generated API-B spec, the change-to-deploy matrix names the\nfunction deploy instead of ECR/ECS, and the PDF Accept symptom is listed.","tree":{"sha":"5e08e9b208a38f345671b85c58c2d091eddc37c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/5e08e9b208a38f345671b85c58c2d091eddc37c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/265489c62b7e8557c5cffab05d78ae5a02f90044","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/265489c62b7e8557c5cffab05d78ae5a02f90044","node_