/api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/5070a06f101d5ce8a89dc80bc2ba9510b0e57ab7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T03:47:53Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T03:47:53Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"feat(cdk): shared-infra drops API-A, the load balancers and the VPC link (C6.3)\n\nAPI-A (SpecRestApi, deployment, stage, access-log group, execution-log\nretention, usage plans, authorizer permission), the ALB and NLB with their\nlisteners and target groups, the ALB security group and the VPC link are\nremoved, with the exports ALBDnsName, ALBArn, AlbSgId, ListenerArn,\nApiGatewayUrl, TenantApiRestApiId, TenantApiRootResourceId and\nTenantApiAuthorizerArn — none had an importer after C6.1 and C6.2. The\nApiGateway construct keeps only the shared authorizer (same construct\npath, so the deployed function keeps its logical id and name). API-B drops\nthe vpcLinkId and nlbDns stage variables no integration used since C5.1\nand now owns the account-level CloudWatch logging role API-A used to own.\nThe route-map spec asserts the five analytics routes from the additions\nfile directly and that the analytics stack attaches nothing to API-A.","tree":{"sha":"7e0a719e9c29da942c6220736e20601eea4cec26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/7e0a719e9c29da942c6220736e20601eea4cec26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/5070a06f101d5ce8a89dc80bc2ba9510b0e57ab7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/5070a06f101d5ce8a89dc80bc2ba9510b0e57ab7","node_id":"C_kwDOP53cGNoAKDUwNzBhMDZmMTAxZDVjZThhODlkYzgwYmMyYmE5NTEwYjBlNTdhYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/9cc718897b5925ef664ef6d38b8bdd213371b8f2","sha":"9cc718897b5925ef664ef6d38b8bdd213371b8f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/9cc718897b5925ef664ef6d38b8bdd213371b8f2"}],"sha":"5070a06f101d5ce8a89dc80bc2ba9510b0e57ab7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/commits/5070a06f101d5ce8a89dc80bc2ba9510b0e57ab7"},{"author":