-b): route /finance to the finance function (C5.1)\n\nroute-map.json: finance → financeFn; the generated API-B spec has 416 Lambda\noperations and no VPC-link operation left. API-A is untouched; the\nshared-infra diff is the API-B body, its deployment and stage only. The\nfinance function already carries the fonts (Sprint 3 fix) and the API-B\nservice URLs for its calls to identity and academics.","tree":{"sha":"ddf797b12202291f676f61d084e0762c27e24cc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/trees/ddf797b12202291f676f61d084e0762c27e24cc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge/git/commits/918c97429159bd5e5839eff62af0a9d98cb8b862","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit/918c97429159bd5e5839eff62af0a9d98cb8b862","node_id":"C_kwDOP53cGNoAKDkxOGM5NzQyOTE1OWJkNWU1ODM5ZWZmNjJhZjBhOWQ5OGNiOGI4NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge/commit